      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "跑不过老头子",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "爸爸，等等我。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你一个年轻小伙子还跑不过我这个老头子。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我拿着伞呢！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我还拿着你的笔袋和保温杯呢。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你猜一下现在多少点了？平时我们都是三十五分左右到楼下的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "17点25！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-09-cant-outrun-an-old-man_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
